<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:
12.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB" lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="text-align:justify;background:white"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;color:#2F5597">Upcoming
conference calls</span></b></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
color:#2F5597">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black"></span></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Brazil
     Update: A conversation with Guilherme Melo, Secretary for Economic
     Policy&nbsp;</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">– Monday, April 10</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at 10:00 AM New
     York, 07:00 AM San Francisco, 11:00 AM Brasilia, 03:00 PM UK| Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_SJ2ajC-nQQW4ZdDeK0fEpA" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Join Eurasia Group’s Managing Director for the
      Americas Christopher Garman and Brazil Director Silvio Cascione to
      discuss the recent updates in Brazil's politics with Guilherme Mello,
      secretary for economic policy.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Taiwan-US-China
     relations: Takeaways from President Tsai's US visit&nbsp;</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">–
     Monday, April 10</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at
     10:15 AM New York, 07:15 AM San Francisco, 11:15 AM Brasilia, 03:15 PM UK|
     Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_3rfE312ySCWz-VLattwxVA" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Taiwan President Tsai Ing-wen&nbsp;arrived
      to&nbsp;fanfare in New York on 31 March. After visiting Central America,
      she will stop for a meeting with House Speaker Kevin McCarthy in
      California on 5 April. Third in line to the presidency, McCarthy will be
      the senior-most US official to meet with a sitting Taiwan president on US
      soil. Beijing denounced the visit and may employ a show of force and
      other measures. Join us to discuss the visit's effects on relations
      between the island, the mainland, and the US.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Andriy
     Zagorodnyuk&nbsp;and Cliff Kupchan&nbsp;—The View from Kyiv&nbsp;</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">–
     Tuesday, April 11</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at
     10:00 AM New York, 07:00 AM San Francisco, 11:00 AM Brasilia, 03:00 PM UK
     | Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_D99plUztSL6b7uI4AGTHdQ" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Join Eurasia Group Chairman Cliff Kupchan&nbsp;for an
      off-the-record call with Andriy Zagorodnyuk, former Minister of Defense
      of Ukraine. Zagorodnyuk&nbsp;will offer perspectives from Kyiv on the
      ongoing war.&nbsp;</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Eurasia
     Group Top Calls April 2023&nbsp;</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">–
     Tuesday, April 11</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at
     11:30 AM New York, 08:30 AM San Francisco, 12:30 PM Brasilia, 04:30 PM UK
     | Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_gG8EfXr2Sceb_HMrXhRMSQ" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Please join Eurasia Group analysts to discuss our Top
      Calls for April 2023, the Eurasia Group calls that could have the biggest
      impact on the global economy and markets.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Europe’s
     energy security and economic outlook coming out of winter - Ronan Lory,
     Henning Gloystein, and Jens Larsen&nbsp;</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">–
     Wednesday, April 12</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at
     10:00 AM New York, 07:00 AM San Francisco, 11:00 AM Brasilia, 03:00 PM UK
     | Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_zhFGhyYoQEiU25Ctw2oexg" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Join Eurasia Group’s Henning Gloystein&nbsp;and Jens
      Larsen as they host Ronan Lory, Edison SpA’s&nbsp;Chief Financial
      Officer, for an off-the-record conversation.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in;background:white;user-select:text;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Mexico’s
     economic outlook </span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">– Thursday, April 20</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><sup><span style="font-size:8.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">th</span></sup></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;at 11:00 AM New
     York, 08:00 AM San Francisco, 12:00 PM Brasilia, 04:00 PM UK| Register </span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_tt7ZPEu_T1KxL6iH9cciPg" target="_blank"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="color:#0563C1;
     text-decoration:none;text-underline:none">here</span></span></a><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="paragraph" style="color:black;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list 1.0in;background:white;user-select:text;list-style-type:
      &quot;o  &quot;;cursor:text"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
      &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Please join us for an off-the-record conversation with
      Banxico’s&nbsp;chief economist to discuss the outlook for the Mexican
      economy. We will discuss Mexico’s outlook for inflation, growth
      projections and key risks.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"></span></li></ul></ul>

